器和调度器可不改\n6、设置图片放大后的最短边分辨率，即最终出图分辨率，放大模块默认关闭\n\n\n\nThe boxes marked in green are the parts that can be modified.\n\n\nOperation process for new players:\n\n1. Load the reference image\n\n2. Select the AUX preprocessor, the DWPreprocessor for posture, and the M-LSD segment preprocessor for architecture\n\n3. Set the image size and the number of output images. By default, they should be consistent with the reference image. Otherwise, you can disconnect the node for obtaining image size\n\n\n\n4. Enter the prompt words\n\n5. The default number of steps is 10, and the sampler and scheduler do not need to be changed\n\n6. Set the resolution of the shortest side of the image after enlargement. The enlargement module is turned off by default"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [430.81976318359375, 462.8635559082031], "pos": [1434.8475341796875, 1204.1094970703125], "id": 53, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [28], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["a080425731478709f89c2dbf11709f58c95ba7304ed17bb2ca77c79ab45c16ed.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [627.071044921875, 693.5787353515625], "pos": [1987.7410888671875, 399.1947326660156], "id": 28, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [8], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [4008.27490234375, 1400.852783203125], "widgets_values": ["retro zimage zit